            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tiffany"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So glad I found this recipe. Just as others stated in their reviews, only 1/2 a pack of the ranch seasoning is needed. I didn't add the mayo either. I've never been a fan of avocados/guacamole but I know how good avocado's are for me. So glad I found a way to enjoy them now. I will be making this more often for sure.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-14T20:30:48.393Z"
          },
